      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "4 My question really is to you: If you win on\nthat, then are you going to go back and argue there was\n6 not one piece of evidence whatsoever that there was any\n7 reasonable likelihood that the Feds would investigate\n8 your case?"
    },
